questions.question:
toCartLine(sku, qty) returns a new object { sku, qty }. This test fails:

import assert from 'node:assert/strict';

test('builds a cart line', () => {
  assert.strictEqual(toCartLine('A1', 2), { sku: 'A1', qty: 2 });
});

The output says: "Values have same structure but are not reference-equal". What is the right fix?

